# Systems Ready Check Implementation Plan (Enhanced & Hardened)

## Goal
Transform the Before Going Live Checklist into a deterministic, agent-executable framework. All operational modules (dashboards, alerts, chaos tests, runbooks, security fuzzers) live strictly inside `ops/` and `petascale/`, completely segregated from the base application (`server/`, `client/`, `shared/`). This plan is grounded in the actual codebase as verified by deep repo scan.

---

