## WS-C: Alerting Rules (Consolidated)

### C1. [ops/alerts/petascale-alerts.yaml](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/ops/alerts/petascale-alerts.yaml)
All Prometheus rules in one file, organized by team:

**Platform Team:**
- `ExportQueueStarvation`: queue_waiting > 50 AND completions = 0 for 5m
- `ExportThroughputStalled`: (already in [60-monitoring.yaml](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/k8s/60-monitoring.yaml))
- `ExportFailuresHigh`: (already in [60-monitoring.yaml](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/k8s/60-monitoring.yaml))
- `RollupRefreshStale`: (already in [60-monitoring.yaml](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/k8s/60-monitoring.yaml))

**Data Team:**
- `ClickHouseSyncLagCritical`: sync lag > 30m
- `ClickHouseDiskFillForecast`: `predict_linear(free_bytes[1h], 86400) < 0`

**Infrastructure Team:**
- `MinIODiskFillForecast`: `predict_linear(minio_cluster_disk_free_bytes[1h], 86400) < 0`
- `ValkeyMemoryPressure`: `redis_used_memory_bytes / redis_maxmemory > 0.9` for 5m
- `CacheHitRateDegraded`: hit rate < 50% for 5m
- `PodOOMKillSpike`: > 3 OOMKilled in 10m
- `NodeDiskPressure`: `node_filesystem_avail_bytes / node_filesystem_size_bytes < 0.1`

**Security Team:**
- `SuspiciousExportVolume`: > 500MB/s export throughput for 5m
- `CSRFFailureSpike`: `rate(http_responses_total{status="403",route="/api/*"}[5m]) > 10`
- `BruteForceLoginAttempts`: `rate(login_attempts_total{result="failed"}[5m]) > 50`

### C2. `ops/alerts/internal-tls-alerts.yaml`
- `InternalTLSNotEnabled`: Advisory alert if internal endpoints are detected without TLS negotiation.

